HydraSDR
========

HydraSDR is maintained by its downstream contributors in the mbound research
workspace. The project is derived from BirriaSDR and retains the original
copyright and license notices on inherited source files.

Primary upstream credit
-----------------------

BirriaSDR was created by Luigi C. and contributors. Its user-space MT7921 SDR
architecture, USB transport, receiver API and firmware work form the foundation
on which HydraSDR was developed.

Additional third-party attribution is recorded in NOTICE and LICENSES/.
